  94:Src/leds/drivers/ws2812b/pwm-ws2812b.c ****  * TRANSMITTING until the NORMAL transfer has completed (including reset tail).
  95:Src/leds/drivers/ws2812b/pwm-ws2812b.c ****  * Delayed interrupts retain ownership; no circular half needs refilling. */
